    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_askForClues.rpy:4
    old "How did one such as yourself in the company of the Thornfalls?"
    new "Como foi que alguém como tu foi parar à companhia dos Thornfall?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_askForClues.rpy:23
    old "What does the lady Grace look like?"
    new "Como é a senhora Grace?"

    # game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_askForClues.rpy:32
    old "Did she say anything that might helps us in those letters while they were still being exchanged?"
    new "Ela disse alguma coisa que pudesse nos ajudar nessas cartas enquanto ainda estavam sendo trocadas?"

